<title>USA: Miltope Group Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Miltope Group Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			     $9,042,000	  $9,950,000</p>
<p> Operating income			 361,000	     438,000</p>
<p> Net income				 174,000	     117,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			0.03		  0.02</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			   5,868,000	   5,867,000</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its lower sales were due to the timing of shipping schedules between the first and second quarters.</p>
<p>Periods ended March 30 vs March 31.</p>
</text>
